      ],
      "text": "Heat scorches those who lay eyes on the nightmarchers. All creatures in a 60-foot cone take 15d6 fire damage (DC 34 basic Reflex save save).\n\nProne creatures and the nightmarchers' kin are unaffected as long as they have not taken a hostile action against the nightmarchers.\n\nThe nightmarchers can't use Blazing Admonition for 1d4 rounds."
    },
