      "text": "The nightmarchers fling a hail of spears and stones, dealing 5d6+9 untyped damage to creatures in a 10-foot burst within 20 feet (DC 31 basic Reflex save save).\n\nWhen the nightmarchers are reduced to 8 or fewer squares, this decreases to a 5-foot burst.",
